## Development Patterns

### Page Functions

Pages follow the loader + component pattern:

```go
func MyPage(r *core.Router) func() core.Node {
    // LOADER: Runs on server (SSR) and client navigation
    var items []Item
    r.OnLoad(func() {
        api.Items.List(func(result []Item, err error) {
            if err == nil {
                items = result
            }
        })
    })

    // COMPONENT: Returns UI, re-runs on state changes
    return func() core.Node {
        return core.Div(core.Class("container"),
            renderItemList(items),
        )
    }
}
```

### State Management

```go
count := r.StateInt("count", 0)        // int
name := r.StateString("name", "")      // string
active := r.StateBool("active", false) // bool
user := core.UseState(r, "user", User{}) // any type

// Read and update
current := count.Get()
count.Set(current + 1)
name.SetQuiet("value") // Update without re-render
```

### Router Methods

```go
r.Param("id")           // Get route parameter
r.Path()                // Current path
r.Query("order_id")     // Get URL query parameter (?order_id=X)
r.Navigate("/path")     // Programmatic navigation
r.User()                // Authenticated user (or nil)
r.IsAuthenticated()     // Check if logged in
r.HasRole("admin")      // Check user role
```

## API Authentication

All CRUD and typed API endpoints are **protected by default** when auth is configured.

### CRUD Endpoints

```go
// Protected by default
app.CRUD(models.Order{})

// Public endpoint (no auth required)
app.CRUD(models.Product{}, core.WithPublic())

// Requires specific role(s)
app.CRUD(models.User{}, core.WithRoles("admin"))
```

### Typed API Endpoints

```go
// Protected by default
core.APIGet(app, "/api/orders", listOrders)

// Public endpoint
core.APIGet(app, "/api/products", listProducts).Public()

// Requires specific role
core.APIGet(app, "/api/stats", getStats).WithRoles("admin")
core.APIDelete(app, "/api/users/:id", deleteUser).WithRoles("admin")
```

### SSR Session Propagation

To enable API calls during SSR to inherit user authentication, add this to app.go:

```go
import "{{.ModulePath}}/guxgen/api"

func init() {
    // Wire up SSR session propagation
    core.SSRSessionSetter = api.SetEndpointSession
    core.SSRSessionClearer = api.ClearEndpointSession
}
```

